face — T-01 decision D-1082-07); `assert_eq` normalizes to explicit
comparisons. The legacy MIXED tuple ("hello", 42) carries a Str slot —
Str-in-tuple locals belong to the text face (verify.local-type on this
face), so the second positional observation rides the int-pair (7, 42);
the Str-slot row stays a named text-face hold.

