## Case: shims-int-list
id: "av.parity.1082.shims-int-list"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1082", "collections"]
links: ["PLAN-1082", "PLAN-335"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() {
 let items = List.new(10, 20, 30)
 print(items.len())
 print(items.get(1))
 items.set(0, 99)
 print(items.get(0))
 items.insert(1, 55)
 print(items.len())
 var popped = 0
 let p = items.pop()
 is p { Some(v) -> { popped = v } None -> { popped = 0 } }
 print(popped)
 items.remove(0)
 print(items.len())
 var contains = 0
 let hit = items.find((x int) => x == 20)
 is hit { Some(v) -> { contains = 1 } None -> { contains = 0 } }
 print(contains)
}
```

