legacy.29_list_shims.001 (Plan 335 full-shim face): `List<int>.new([10,
20, 30])` normalizes to the varargs sugar; `pop()` prints through the
Option unwrap (the frozen stdlib pop keeps the None-not-trap contract);
`contains(55)` normalizes to the real 972 `find` family (contains is
not a face method — auditable; after remove(0) the list is [55, 20] so
find(==20) = Some → 1 keeps the original '1').

